    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886060/extras/4eacd5f2bb8f8845a40497572eb666c1.avif?t=1737053617\" width=550 height=250 /></span><br>In the game The Backrooms Company you will assume the role of a member of an elite group working for the mysterious corporation &quot;The Backrooms&quot;. Your team will be sent to the dark and mysterious places of our planet, where mysterious phenomena occur, to fulfill a certain contract.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886060/extras/f6b07298128904878ce58bc8260a0c45.avif?t=1737053617\" width=550 height=300 /></span><br>But not everything is so simple: in addition to completing tasks, you will have to survive in a place where every step can be your last. You'll have to fight for survival, avoiding dangers and battling dark forces that you could never have guessed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886060/extras/20d893c148cee9528fbaca647d85f1a3.avif?t=1737053617\" width=550 height=200 /></span><br>In addition, you will be able to earn extra money by selling various items and information found during your travels. Be prepared that every trip you take comes with risks and opportunities at the same time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886060/extras/d0b594b8527a5e6d66f686ba826cfef7.avif?t=1737053617\" width=550 height=250 /></span><br>Despite the simple plot, the game attracts with its beautiful graphics and addictive gameplay.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beautiful graphics<br></li><li>Cooperative/Single-player game<br></li><li>Different character classes<br></li><li>Interesting gameplay<br></li><li>Realistic atmosphere<br></li><li>Edit and improve the character's characteristics/vehicles</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886060/extras/495d48313b86f504379ea0e056ba2a0a.avif?t=1737053617\" width=550 height=183 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886060/extras/d578893a23131249c46c0e5ff17b26dd.avif?t=1737053617\" width=550 height=250 /></span>",
